# ============================================================
# Microdata protection
# Real survey microdata (IFLS or any other) must never be
# committed to this public repository. These patterns block the
# common formats as a LAST line of defense -- the first line is:
# never copy real microdata into this folder tree at all.
# Only the SIMULATED dataset in data/simulated/ is allowed.
# ============================================================
*.dta
!data/simulated/*.dta
data/simulated/tmp_*.dta
*.sav
*.por
*.sas7bdat
*.xpt
*.dbf
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.rds
*.parquet
# (if the repo ever needs to ship a legitimate csv/xlsx, re-include it
#  explicitly with a !path/file line here)

# Stata byproducts
*.log
*.smcl
*.stpr
*.stses
*.gph

# Class-generated output
results/
data/simulated/wage_survey_clean.dta

# LaTeX build artifacts (the deck's .tex, .pdf and figures ARE tracked)
*.aux
*.nav
*.out
*.snm
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk

# Temp and office junk
~$*
*.tmp
*.bak

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Instructor-only material, unpublished for now (session script, AI guide,
# deck outline). Remove this line for any file that should ship.
instructor/
